<<link [[가만히 있는다|Underground Brothel Contract Quarters]]>><<set $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience to Math.min(5, $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience + 1)>><<stress -4>><<trauma -2>><<pass 30>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
